DragonFruit hollowing engine, native Rust port
==============================================

This crate ports the voxel hollowing engine of:

  DragonFruit, Open Resin Alliance and contributors
  https://github.com/Open-Resin-Alliance/DragonFruit
  SynrgStudio private downstream revision f331fc555abb31c4bcb28d1a358edb887f0afe07

from these files, each named again in the header of the module that ports it:

  rust/dragonfruit-mesh-repair/src/hollowing.rs   -> src/hollowing.rs (+ tests)
  rust/dragonfruit-mesh-repair/src/smoothing.rs   -> src/smoothing.rs
  rust/dragonfruit-mesh-core/src/mesh.rs          -> src/mesh.rs
  rust/dragonfruit-mesh-core/src/bvh.rs           -> src/bvh.rs
  rust/dragonfruit-mesh-core/src/halfedge.rs      -> src/topology.rs

Both DragonFruit crates are licensed MIT by their own LICENSE files
(Copyright (c) 2026 Open Resin Alliance), separately from the AGPL-3.0 of the
DragonFruit application root. That license is reproduced in COPYING and covers
this crate, including the parts written for the SoulCrafted Slicer by
SynrgStudio (src/drain.rs, src/punch.rs, src/engine.rs, src/control.rs,
src/shapes.rs). The hollowing improvements of the DragonFruit revision above
(parallel slab voxelization, surface-only preview, model-local grid) are
SynrgStudio's own commits to DragonFruit.

The SoulCrafted Slicer is AGPL-3.0; MIT code is compatible with it.
No code from Lychee or any other closed slicer is included.
